  m_text: It might come as a surprise for you, but the <b><color="red">A.I.</color></b>
    in this game stands for <u><b><color="red">A</color></b>rtificial <b><color="red">I</color></b>diot</u>
    and not Artificial Intelligence. I doubt it had actually really helped with solving
    the puzzles or with anything during the game, and if by some miracle it did,
    I can assure you, that it was without intention.
